Notebook[{Cell["CechObstruction", "ObjectName", ExpressionUUID -> "28d2a511-9b04-42b4-b212-960ea8ace592"], Cell["CechObstruction[scen, e] gives the \[CapitalCHacek]ech cohomological obstruction data of the support presheaf of the empirical model e on the scenario scen (Abramsky-Mansfield-Barbosa; Abramsky-Barbosa-Kishida-Lal-Mansfield, arXiv:1502.03097): a support section s over a context is obstructed when its class \[Gamma](s) in the first \[CapitalCHacek]ech cohomology of the relative Z-linearized support presheaf is nonzero, equivalently (arXiv:1502.03097, Prop. 4.4) when NO compatible family of Z-linear combinations of support sections restricts to s. Returns an association with keys \"Obstructed\"/\"ObstructedCount\"/\"SectionCount\", \"ObstructionOrder\" ({context, section} -> least n >= 1 with n \[Gamma](s) = 0, by Smith normal form: 1 means \[Gamma](s) = 0, Infinity means rationally obstructed, finite n > 1 is pure relative torsion - every GHZ class has order exactly 2), \"NonextendableSections\" (sections with no global support assignment through them) and \"FalseNegatives\", \"GlobalSupportSize\", \"H0Rank\" (rank of the compatible-family module), \"SupportNoSignalling\", and the witness flags \"CohLogicallyContextual\" (some \[Gamma](s) != 0: certifies logical contextuality) and \"CohStronglyContextual\" (every \[Gamma](s) != 0: certifies strong contextuality). Vanishing of \[Gamma] is not conclusive - the Hardy model is the canonical false negative.", "Usage", ExpressionUUID -> "cf03ab04-0f08-4eeb-8eb0-05f202103b1a"], Cell["Basic Examples", "Section", ExpressionUUID -> "8d7181c6-a75e-4fab-b378-bac1514c5cb2"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"CechObstruction", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"CycleScenario", "[", "5", "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"CycleModel", "[", RowBox[{"5", ",", "\"Wright\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "[", "\"CohStronglyContextual\"", "]"}]], "Input", ExpressionUUID -> "b030ac90-6e8f-4f09-b00b-63e0fb842594"]}, FrontEndVersion -> "15.0 for Microsoft Windows (64-bit) (May 19, 2026)", StyleDefinitions -> "Default.nb", ExpressionUUID -> "757eac89-17e7-427c-9908-9457c125cb8e"]
(* End of Notebook Content *)
